 "long_description": "The new map \"Poligon\" is now available. Enjoy :)\n\nEnjoy the  virtual reality game experience with Shooting Practice! You can amplify the difficulty levels with the options of different maps and day/night cycles. Race with challenging bots or create tournaments with the local multiplayer option and increase the fun with your friends.", "short_description": "Race with challenging bots or create tournaments with the local multiplayer option and increase the fun!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1817770805711255", "locale": "tr_TR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Shooting Practice", "keywords": ["At\u0131\u015f", "Poligon", "Turnuva", "Spor", "Aksiyon"], "long_description": "Yeni harita \"Poligon\" art\u0131k haz\u0131r. Tad\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n :)\n\nShooting Practice ile sanal ger\u00e7eklik oyunu deneyiminin tad\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n! Farkl\u0131 harita se\u00e7enekleri ve g\u00fcnd\u00fcz/gece d\u00f6ng\u00fcleri ile zorluk seviyelerini art\u0131rabilirsiniz. Zorlu botlarla yar\u0131\u015f\u0131n veya yerel \u00e7ok oyunculu se\u00e7ene\u011fiyle turnuvalar olu\u015fturun ve e\u011flenceyi art\u0131r\u0131n!", "short_description": "Zorlu botlarla yar\u0131\u015f\u0131n veya yerel \u00e7ok oyunculu se\u00e7ene\u011fiyle turnuvalar olu\u015fturun ve e\u011flenceyi art\u0131r\u0131n!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.northironstudios.com/shootingpractice/spocprivacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NorthIron Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.northironstudios.com/shootingpractice", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "